                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.22371/2610.22371v1/teaser_v2.png",
                "caption": "Figure 1:Gen4Prepurposes a multi-step VideoGenerator into a single-step4DPerceiver,\nenabling unified feed-forward prediction of dense 3D tracks, point maps, depth maps, and camera poses from a video input.\nGen4P is able to track complex motion while maintaining the delicate structure of in-the-wild content, like the thin legs of the flamingo and long-range skiing motion.",
                "position": 283
            }
